fetch, write batching, long keys, commit order, action authority, SQL-read authorization and the increments revised in §4–§6 and §9–§12); 2026-09-15 (§14: the author's rulings); 2026-09-15 (rewritten after a directional review: one executor over both stores with transaction-scoped prefetch instead of lowering Quarry to SQL; Postgres as a persistence target; projections as the only database-native form of managed data; an online-only brief with Convex and Supabase controls first); 2026-09-15 (initial design, grounded in the current authoring surface and Postgres evaluation prototype)
